  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Velocity of projectile at time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mover><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>10</mn><mfrac><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>or <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>On comparing, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ...(i)</p><p>and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ...(ii)</p><p>From Eqs (i) and (ii), we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p>",
